Effect: (destination_node_ready ?destination_node)

Thus (activate_destination_node destination_availability_alpha destination_node_alpha route_task_profile_alpha)

Now destination_node_ready true.

Step 9: Load destination payload.

Action: load_destination_payload
Parameters: ?destination_availability - destination_candidate_availability ?destination_node - destination_node ?payload_unit - cargo_payload
Precondition: (candidate_prepared ?destination_availability) (destination_availability_node_linked ?destination_availability ?destination_node) (cargo_available ?payload_unit) (not (destination_availability_locked ?destination_availability))
